WEBVTT

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:33.436
We can clean up the mess we’ve made,

00:02:33.436 --> 00:02:36.836
and we can give our world
a chance to heal.

00:02:39.636 --> 00:02:41.276
So what do the removals look like?

00:02:41.276 --> 00:02:44.036
I’ve been talking to a lot of people
about carbon removals,

00:02:44.036 --> 00:02:47.516
from business executives
to climate activists,

00:02:47.516 --> 00:02:49.236
and they tend to go one of two ways.

00:02:49.236 --> 00:02:51.756
They either think of trees

00:02:51.756 --> 00:02:54.716
or they think of big, futuristic machines.

00:02:54.876 --> 00:02:56.716
Nature versus tech;

00:02:56.716 --> 00:02:58.756
green versus chrome.